            <div xml:id="m-6d592655-4356-4fde-8acf-228d7fcbbced">
              <lg xml:id="m-c704085a-6c19-4e1d-830f-81223a062684">
                <l xml:id="m-7fb9663e-5bfe-4ce9-b3a0-3d6bef2f70a0" facs="#m-60e0c984-928d-43a7-ae5d-efe860af3f3b" label="ambiguous">100s</l><l xml:id="m-fe425e66-f10c-44b7-95eb-23da3d8763f2" facs="#m-db969572-f141-47ad-b3bd-79cbc61d8b55" label="text-like">oth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-93052657-86d1-4e1b-9954-6dd9b6e283f4" facs="#m-9dd59d58-aa11-49b0-b276-b390653302f4" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-6ba65e48-ecb8-4dba-b96b-3ea792e248f4" facs="#m-1057788a-341b-4b7e-b6ef-b8d878b43dae" label="lyrics-like">A Lle-lú¬ ia. "7.</l><l xml:id="m-6549619c-f23b-4b7a-8566-3df2162312e3" facs="#m-e236bd9c-8714-4360-bccf-9c2dea956727" label="lyrics-like">V. In te Dómi¬ ne</l><l xml:id="m-f2a49f2e-1904-4c46-99ca-c389519c5395" facs="#m-683b5be9-c3c3-4ab9-8fb0-71ea7fa0a4ca" label="lyrics-like">vi, non confún¬</l><l xml:id="m-36169d9d-a3ac-49ac-b407-278a0c5b50e9" facs="#m-ab1652c3-7e52-430b-8659-d95f7395243e" label="lyrics-like">spe-rá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7210f33b-f408-4747-bf67-4a4f5599ce78" facs="#m-d3605694-c83c-483d-9662-c85b77ab88c8" label="lyrics-like">num : in tú- a justí-ti-a líbe¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb7c0d1b-fc60-41de-a1c1-b16045498258" facs="#m-82725a6d-7a0b-468e-8854-5362b7d405cc" label="lyrics-like">dar in ae-tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-9e7de501-3e37-49cb-a299-3fa15ca064bd" facs="#m-46c76b20-67ff-4137-8f09-abcfc7e72df5" label="lyrics-like">ad me áu¬</l><l xml:id="m-c132a174-7393-4057-bf0f-87982edddcdc" facs="#m-a92f7d7f-cd92-4016-8b4f-0c832c519529" label="lyrics-like">ra me, et é-ri-pe</l><l xml:id="m-a35193d3-1fba-4b00-8b19-7225e8cc1df7" facs="#m-bedd6754-7428-465f-a7b4-3f9bc9bb0ee2" label="lyrics-like">me: inclí- na</l><l xml:id="m-353ca8ca-4295-43ca-a3e3-0835e14fcae2" facs="#m-148f622b-8fff-4fee-bcfb-03409d4692e1" label="lyrics-like">rem tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-ed6ee865-305c-457f-97d7-45e7cb40f986" facs="#m-8f535009-8755-4d74-b881-b180cbdc8ce5" label="lyrics-like">ra *ut e-rí-pi-as</l><l xml:id="m-5f96884e-270f-4ef4-aaf7-5971ca136591" facs="#m-f65669f4-0849-41c4-9442-9a420f2c1128" label="lyrics-like">am, accé¬ le¬</l><l xml:id="m-be3290b1-979d-4539-9adf-ed7d1891faa9" facs="#m-7110587a-04f5-4015-9298-6096c2113d00" label="ambiguous">me.</l><l xml:id="m-60e89c9f-8f2c-4c07-ae66-8de3ddee2fff" facs="#m-4f55b6cd-02bd-4924-b16c-fd5c3fc7c981" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Marcum. Marc. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-3878143e-c5aa-4a73-96c9-b4b3a66990bc" facs="#m-98a7aca4-efad-4981-9726-ecbad5e53d05" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Cum turba mul- bétis? Qui dixérunt: Septem. Et</l><l xml:id="m-caa22dcb-21a6-4c3d-887e-910a3f1dc475" facs="#m-1eab7060-bbde-4091-b98c-6561538ad111" label="lyrics-like">Lta esset cum Jesu, nec habérent! praecépit turbae discúmbere super</l><l xml:id="m-02e9472f-ec9d-4b49-aec6-16778c3f745c" facs="#m-30a8e01f-a6b6-4136-ac22-aea72d1d9fce" label="lyrics-like">quod manducárent, convocátis di¬</l><l xml:id="m-7df78099-2afd-40b2-a2f0-12c2daa73c04" facs="#m-23538ce3-727b-4177-a4bd-49bc1ff5b687" label="lyrics-like">terram. Et accípiens septem panes,</l><l xml:id="m-753217bc-9681-4b26-99c0-0c4ac5851b5e" facs="#m-f691d973-a9b8-4e61-916d-86dfffbb50dc" label="lyrics-like">grátias agens fregit, et dabat disci¬</l><l xml:id="m-198d6454-a070-424c-95a6-96b708f4245d" facs="#m-01b04d68-cc2e-4b2e-ad29-3a48e9b3d693" label="lyrics-like">scípulis, ait illis: Miséreor super</l><l xml:id="m-d115a10f-c12b-42db-b3f1-dd8b8e94e001" facs="#m-8895a25a-3362-4da6-aa18-041715d70b19" label="lyrics-like">turbam: quia ecce jam tríduo sús¬</l><l xml:id="m-52599b43-1320-4628-be21-e72d1faf85ad" facs="#m-1dc881b2-bcc6-4475-8ebb-b58e130fcb21" label="lyrics-like">pulis suis, ut appónerent, et appo¬</l><l xml:id="m-44fdf4a2-5490-4522-bb6b-35d57c9efb00" facs="#m-76d36032-ebaf-4745-a2cd-878b2ce36c1a" label="lyrics-like">suérunt turbae. Et habébant pisci.</l><l xml:id="m-882deff5-aa61-4703-b576-b34ea4ed6a60" facs="#m-f3ac0373-2a45-495a-a4bd-5a669334baa4" label="ambiguous">tinent me, nec habent quod man¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e0ecba9-36ef-4928-943b-c0cecc5a9e19" facs="#m-b7987154-90ac-448c-9495-79ee3d08147d" label="lyrics-like">dúcent: et si dimísero eos jejúnos</l><l xml:id="m-359c6e33-1bc3-4414-bfee-6e5d8cdf9aab" facs="#m-4f3c0b63-1f54-4197-a2c5-87bd713d01d0" label="ambiguous">culos paucos: et ipsos benedixit, et</l><l xml:id="m-7f784138-99d6-4c90-85cf-92078684f424" facs="#m-3d69e5fd-203b-4b00-96c5-3eb80e77b10b" label="lyrics-like">jussit appóni. Et manducavérunt, et</l><l xml:id="m-14265a2c-eb8e-4ea9-a634-f785e0167561" facs="#m-ad0cb904-d988-46f1-b618-76a18183c253" label="ambiguous">in domum suam, deficient in via:</l><l xml:id="m-7c8037da-1d4d-49ad-8e8a-3fc309263231" facs="#m-9e7f5907-e39e-4807-a960-5d348699433f" label="lyrics-like">quidam enim ex eis de longe vené¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2643944-760c-4ea3-8d6f-4a4489ebcdf0" facs="#m-09c8a7e6-142d-4ae9-b4a4-8546e62703fb" label="lyrics-like">saturáti sunt, et sustulérunt quoc</l><l xml:id="m-31f7e826-4350-46f9-a506-ccb46faae2f3" facs="#m-8c9e66e5-bb68-462a-b0cf-ab8863680b9c" label="lyrics-like">runt. Et respondérunt ei discipuli</l><l xml:id="m-eddd9445-1ddc-47e6-a521-47d7c2761ff5" facs="#m-743883bf-348e-418d-9947-d9c72e5bd8bd" label="lyrics-like">superáverat de fragméntis, septer</l><l xml:id="m-84e4abca-a02f-45a0-b648-12cb9ba0025f" facs="#m-1fd2f712-3c71-484c-91f2-4e02ad0cf2c3" label="lyrics-like">sui: Unde illos quis póterit hic</l><l xml:id="m-a8fc2668-63a6-4107-8d46-fb2c0180502b" facs="#m-8b6b1779-feec-4457-84bb-6e8a5ba1c70c" label="ambiguous">sportas. Erant autem qui mandu¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a8bab56-25dd-4660-9ae6-42ffb06e8793" facs="#m-3fafb9c0-7f3f-43df-91aa-74c890728acb" label="lyrics-like">saturáre pánibus in solitúdine? Etl cáverant, quasi quátuor millia: e</l><l xml:id="m-71251830-71f3-444e-bbff-c7a9e90ae40d" facs="#m-a2a2ecb7-78b3-4924-b03b-05d50be8efaf" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-d2d9d1d4-9e15-4c91-b97d-6d8a8266b06e" facs="#m-93ab59d3-ac6d-40ed-b79f-770f454e5bbf" label="lyrics-like">interrogávit eos: Quot panes ha- dimísit eos.</l><l xml:id="m-3288cf5d-44d9-4404-a711-eab866f4e7ff" facs="#m-1076c8e1-c095-4cbd-9270-8d9d4f425895" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Pérfice gréssus méos. D. 808.</l><l xml:id="m-c64aae47-71e2-47a8-8250-efcf47098a3d" facs="#m-59076cdc-fa61-449b-b952-d1517c08653b" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-cf2e1a5d-ac60-4f1e-b1fb-08da2064caf1" facs="#m-003495d3-1238-4454-aada-7b0346c2b2fb" label="lyrics-like">DRopitiáre, Dómine, supplicatió-] vácua postulátio, praesta; ut quoc</l><l xml:id="m-a024bfa3-c8a5-4b36-9505-2b5551b5b355" facs="#m-f51e3e6b-18db-41f8-9187-c0d9b63d2a62" label="lyrics-like">L nibus nostris, et has pópuli tui</l><l xml:id="m-1d6281f1-a8a0-40ce-93ea-854d31a1817d" facs="#m-a9883cbe-4f29-4bd8-85a0-3a9ea82b4be6" label="lyrics-like">fidéliter pétimus, efficáciter conse</l><l xml:id="m-1e86d5d5-2a32-44cb-993b-0071d32a413c" facs="#m-48cdfec8-a108-4d52-bdec-c41bbe03b720" label="lyrics-like">oblatiónes benignus assúme: et ut ! quámur. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-e9f1d9d4-488e-455a-912c-b3f4a28cb4ed" facs="#m-184002c6-a117-4bbc-9aab-80efdb2abd5f" label="lyrics-like">nullius sit írritum votum, nullius</l><l xml:id="m-0ddf40dc-7232-431a-9cb5-9158d2bab88b" facs="#m-a734330a-89d0-4dd4-9b56-cb70cca2a2f5" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
